# fixedbugs, defect 2413, lane b29-boundary, 2026-11-10.
#
# The shape beside `unsupported/fixedbugs-2413-a-hero-os-name-bound-under-a-
# header-that-does-not-declare-it-is-refused`: a header of the program's own
# that includes `hero_os.h` declares its names, so a group naming it binds
# them; the header compiled alone finds each one, and the program builds and
# runs as it did before the refusal landed.

extern "fixedbugs-2413-my-os.h"
    function hero_os_pid() -> i64
    constant HERO_OS_OK: i64

function main()
    print(hero_os_pid() > 0, HERO_OS_OK)
